1
00:00:00,394 --> 00:00:02,781
Every woman is already beautiful.

2
00:00:03,394 --> 00:00:07,079
A good hairstyle and the right lip colour go a long way,

3
00:00:07,119 --> 00:00:09,706
but confidence is what makes you shine.

4
00:00:10,319 --> 00:00:11,829
Beauty Within is a web app

5
00:00:11,869 --> 00:00:13,894
built on the YouCam API.

6
00:00:14,519 --> 00:00:17,466
Pick a sample portrait, or use your camera,

7
00:00:17,506 --> 00:00:19,466
where YouCam's JS Camera Kit

8
00:00:19,506 --> 00:00:21,519
guides your face into place.

9
00:00:22,202 --> 00:00:25,799
The Facial Color Tones Analyzer reads her real skin,

10
00:00:25,839 --> 00:00:27,099
lip and eye colour,

11
00:00:27,139 --> 00:00:30,164
and the Face Analyzer reads her face shape.

12
00:00:30,764 --> 00:00:33,927
Everything after this starts from her own colours.

13
00:00:34,711 --> 00:00:37,246
Her clothes palette comes from her undertone

14
00:00:37,286 --> 00:00:40,211
and the contrast between her skin and hair.

15
00:00:40,836 --> 00:00:43,558
She picks an outfit from YouCam's catalogue,

16
00:00:43,598 --> 00:00:46,373
and AI Clothes puts it on her photo.

17
00:00:47,116 --> 00:00:49,891
Hairstyles are chosen for her face shape.

18
00:00:50,491 --> 00:00:53,788
AI Hairstyle layers the cut onto the same look,

19
00:00:53,828 --> 00:00:55,941
and keeps her own hair colour.

20
00:00:56,722 --> 00:01:00,807
Then the only makeup: a lip tint at her exact lip depth,

21
00:01:00,847 --> 00:01:03,384
with a touch of rose, pink or red.

22
00:01:04,009 --> 00:01:07,332
Makeup Virtual Try-On runs with skin smoothing off,

23
00:01:07,372 --> 00:01:09,497
so her skin stays as it is.

24
00:01:10,109 --> 00:01:12,697
Tap the photo to zoom in and compare.

25
00:01:13,334 --> 00:01:15,444
The choices stack into one look,

26
00:01:15,484 --> 00:01:17,922
and any of them can come off again.

27
00:01:18,623 --> 00:01:22,520
In Care, she tells us about herself: vegetarian,

28
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:25,960
fifty-eight kilos, and worried about hair fall.

29
00:01:26,573 --> 00:01:28,795
AI Skin Analysis leads with

30
00:01:28,835 --> 00:01:30,460
what's already working.

31
00:01:31,073 --> 00:01:33,958
Care from within lists the nutrients involved,

32
00:01:33,998 --> 00:01:37,608
the published daily amounts, vegetarian foods only,

33
00:01:37,648 --> 00:01:40,735
and simple habits, each with its source.

34
00:01:41,431 --> 00:01:44,281
The same rules work for every skin tone.

35
00:01:44,893 --> 00:01:48,291
Here the tint follows a deeper lip at its own depth,

36
00:01:48,331 --> 00:01:50,581
and the outfit follows her colours.

37
00:01:51,337 --> 00:01:52,772
Results are cached,

38
00:01:52,812 --> 00:01:55,537
and the API key stays on the server.

39
00:01:56,149 --> 00:01:59,634
For shoppers and stores, that means fewer wrong buys,

40
00:01:59,674 --> 00:02:02,549
and more women seeing themselves as they are.

41
00:02:03,162 --> 00:02:06,349
Beauty Within, built with the YouCam API.

